<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr" data-bs-theme="dark">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>EZS Orchestrator V2 — Infrastructure</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/ezs-infrastructure.css">
    <script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.7.1.min.js" defer></script>
    <script src="/assets/ezs-infrastructure.js" defer></script>
    <script src="/assets/ezs-gpu-monitor.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
    <header class="navbar navbar-dark bg-dark">
        <div class="container-fluid">
            <span class="navbar-brand mb-0 h1">EZS Orchestrator V2</span>
            <span class="badge text-bg-secondary">DEV · Consultation</span>
        </div>
    </header>
    {% include 'infrastructure/_gpu_monitor.html.twig' %}
    <nav class="ezs-nav" aria-label="Navigation principale"><a href="/" aria-current="page">Infrastructure</a><span>Files &amp; Jobs · en migration</span><span>Déploiements · en migration</span></nav>
    <main class="container-fluid py-4 ezs-main">
        <h1 class="h3 mb-2">Infrastructure</h1>
        <p class="text-body-secondary">Environnements autorisés. Aucun service ni job ne peut être démarré depuis cette page.</p>
        <section class="card shadow-sm" aria-labelledby="environments-title">
            <div class="card-header d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between gap-3 flex-wrap">
                <h2 id="environments-title" class="h5 mb-0">Environnements</h2>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" id="refresh-environments">Actualiser</button>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <p class="small text-body-secondary" id="environment-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite">Catalogue initial affiché.</p>
                <div class="table-responsive">
                    <table class="table table-striped table-hover align-middle">
                        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Composant</th><th scope="col">Environnement</th><th scope="col">Maintenance</th></tr></thead>
                        <tbody id="environment-rows">
                            {% for environment in environments %}
                                <tr>
                                    <td>{{ environment.component }}</td>
                                    <td>{{ environment.environment|upper }}</td>
                                    <td>{{ environment.maintenance ? 'Disponible' : 'Non applicable' }}</td>
                                </tr>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="card shadow-sm mt-3" aria-labelledby="dev-health-title">
            <div class="card-header d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2">
                <h2 id="dev-health-title" class="h5 mb-0">Services DEV — supervision HTTP</h2>
                <button type="button" id="refresh-dev-health" class="btn btn-outline-info btn-sm">Actualiser</button>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <p id="dev-health-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite" class="small text-body-secondary">En attente de la première mesure.</p>
                <div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-striped align-middle">
                    <thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Port DEV</th><th>TCP</th><th>Réponse HTTP</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody id="dev-health-rows"></tbody>
                </table></div>
                <p class="small text-body-secondary">Contrôle HTTP local uniquement. Une réponse ne garantit pas la disponibilité fonctionnelle. Aucun appel PROD.</p>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="card shadow-sm mt-3" aria-labelledby="prod-maintenance-title">
            <div class="card-header"><h2 id="prod-maintenance-title" class="h5 mb-0">EZScore PROD — maintenance</h2></div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <p><span class="badge text-bg-secondary">État indéterminé</span> Aucun mécanisme PROD vérifié n'est encore raccordé.</p>
                <p class="small text-body-secondary mb-0">Activation et désactivation indisponibles : contrôles d'autorisation, état réel persistant, audit et isolation Caddy PROD obligatoires avant mise en service. Le port 8501 reste inchangé.</p>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="card shadow-sm mt-3" aria-labelledby="listeners-title">
            <div class="card-header d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between flex-wrap gap-2">
                <h2 class="h5 mb-0" id="listeners-title">Ports DEV — état TCP</h2>
                <button class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" type="button" id="refresh-listeners">Vérifier</button>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <p class="text-body-secondary small" id="listeners-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite">État non vérifié.</p>
                <div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-striped">
                    <thead><tr><th>Composant</th><th>Port</th><th>Écoute TCP</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody id="listener-rows"></tbody>
                </table></div>
                <p class="small text-body-secondary">Une écoute TCP ne prouve ni la santé applicative ni le propriétaire du processus. Aucun test PROD.</p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
